Rumble wrote:
> 1. how do i bring a pet archon down passed the castle lever if the
> level does not have a staircase?

Levitate over the trapdoor and jump into the hole when your pet is
adjacent.

Without levitation, level-teleport down when your pet is adjacent.

In both cases your pet should not be immobile and should not eat,
otherwise it would not follow you.

Or magic whistle your pet it into the trap, then follow him. If your
pet is able to fly then displace him when he is over the trap.

